        ("Gables by the Sea", "Unarmed guards work from guardhouses around the clock here, under a security district that was split in 2022 into a Coral Gables side and a [[city:pinecrest|Pinecrest]] side. Tell the gate which side you live on and that a bee crew is expected."),
        ("Snapper Creek and Hammock Lakes", "Both are among the security districts the city now runs after taking them over from the county. Expect a gate or a patrol to ask who you are, so give us the name on the guard list and any vehicle rules before the visit."),
